WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:03.085
Welcome to the Federal
Modernization Workbook's

2
00:00:03.085 --> 00:00:05.750
developer workbook, Building Defender XDR.

3
00:00:05.750 --> 00:00:09.625
This is Chapter 1: access,
and the Graph read path.

4
00:00:09.625 --> 00:00:12.775
Every check in this workbook
reads through one door.

5
00:00:12.775 --> 00:00:17.182
Before anything else, we prove the door
is the right one, in the right cloud,

6
00:00:17.182 --> 00:00:21.075
and that the people behind it hold
only what the design gave them.

7
00:00:21.075 --> 00:00:25.737
We'll start from Microsoft Learn's
commands, read how the kit declares its

8
00:00:25.737 --> 00:00:30.400
calls and checks its roles, and walk
two labs, the evidence and the dangers.

9
00:00:30.400 --> 00:00:33.499
The chapter is a draft
awaiting the owner's review,

10
00:00:33.499 --> 00:00:36.960
and the code is illustrative,
tested against fixtures.
